<title>USA: Microchip Tech named to Nasdaq-100 Index.</title>
<headline>Microchip Tech named to Nasdaq-100 Index.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-06-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Nasdaq Stock Market said on Monday that Microchip Technology Inc will become a component of the Nasdaq-100 Index effective June 4, replacing SunGard Data Systems Inc.</p>
<p>Microchip Tech, with a capitalization of about $1.8 billion, is a supplier of filed programmable 8-bit micro-controllers and related specialty memory products for embedded control applications.</p>
<p>The Nasdaq-100 Index is a benchmark for large growth stocks traded on the Nasdaq Stock Market.</p>
</text>
